  triage:title "serve_with_deadlines_and_accept_probe exceeds RULE-002 80-line limit (~479 lines)" ;
  triage:description "local_ipc_transport.rs:290-768 — function serve_with_deadlines_and_accept_probe is approximately 479 lines, 6x the RULE-002 80-line limit. Contains separable concerns: accept loop, lifecycle-waiter thread, shutdown drain, finalization. Pre-existing finding first surfaced in S4 zero-tolerance review." ;
